abstract: >
  The Accountability Layer Framework (ALF) is the organizational
  accountability architecture operating above the technical enforcement
  layer of AI governance systems — named accountable authorities,
  structured escalation, evidence requirements, and governed post-incident
  review. This public repository contains the executive summary and
  architecture diagram; the full v4.0 technical specification is available
  upon request.
